WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.667
So there's a new

00:00:00.667 --> 00:00:02.377
Wikipedia article for the crisis

00:00:02.377 --> 00:00:04.087
happening in the Red Sea.

00:00:04.087 --> 00:00:04.671
Let’s look at the map.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.047
This is the Red Sea.

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:06.589
It's where

00:00:06.589 --> 00:00:08.717
tens of thousands of merchant ships

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:09.551
travel through

00:00:09.551 --> 00:00:11.177
to keep our global economy running.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:13.013
Lately, rebels in Yemen

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.389
have been firing missiles

00:00:14.389 --> 00:00:16.891
and drones at these cargo ships.

00:00:16.891 --> 00:00:17.267
You can see

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.476
all of these attacks here right

00:00:18.476 --> 00:00:19.477
at this choke point

00:00:19.477 --> 00:00:21.438
where Yemen and Djibouti come together.

00:00:21.438 --> 00:00:21.771
So far,

00:00:21.771 --> 00:00:22.689
the rebels have hit like

00:00:22.689 --> 00:00:24.232
ten of these cargo ships.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.316
And they say they're doing it

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:27.861
to punish Israel and its backers

00:00:27.861 --> 00:00:29.320
for this war that's happening in Gaza.

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:29.946
This is a nightmare

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:30.780
for shipping companies

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:32.365
who are now having to reroute their ships

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.992
to much longer routes.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.827
And it's causing all these price issues

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:36.870
and it's not good.

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:38.747
This, waterway is very critical

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:39.622
to the global economy.

00:00:39.622 --> 00:00:41.207
So the U.S. and U.K.

00:00:41.207 --> 00:00:42.542
and other countries are sending

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:43.209
in their navies,

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.377
intercepting these attacks

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:45.462
and trying to stabilize

00:00:45.462 --> 00:00:46.755
this vital waterway.

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.839
This waterway affects all of us

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:49.090
because we are all attached

00:00:49.090 --> 00:00:49.966
to the global economy,

00:00:49.966 --> 00:00:51.009
whether we like it or not.

00:00:51.009 --> 00:00:52.093
So I’m going to keep an eye on this.

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:52.886
If you want to better understand

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.846
global politics, follow along for more.

